<title>USA: SatCon optimistic for profitable 1998.</title>
<headline>SatCon optimistic for profitable 1998.</headline>
<dateline>CAMBRIDGE, Mass. 1997-08-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>SatCon Technology Corp said Wednesday that it sees an improvement in its financial performance during its fiscal fourth quarter.</p>
<p>The company said it remains optimistic about its potential to achieve overall profitability during fiscal 1998.</p>
<p>Also Wednesday, the company reported third quarter revenue of $3.1 million, compared with $2.1 million for the same period in the prior year.</p>
<p>For the quarter, the company reported a net loss of $300,000 or $0.04 per share, compared with a net loss of $500,000 or $0.07 per share for the quarter ended June 30, 1996.</p>
</text>
